      "description": "Filtered by $operation (default All, aggregated). Selecting a specific operation also drops the shaded band and dashed \"level\" line below, since rules/saafe/anomaly.yml's baseline for this p95 query (anomaly_name=\"canonical_latency_p95\") isn't scoped by operation; a filled marker under \"anomalies\" means AnomalyDetected fired.",
